anese music and voiceover included for maximum authenticity, Dragon Ball: Revenge of King Piccolo offers fans a dazzling new experience with the characters and universe they know and love.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/dragon-ball-revenge-of-king-piccolo", "videos": [{"id": 8824, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "guDNNKRA8Ck", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=guDNNKRA8Ck", "title": "Dragon Ball: Revenge of King Piccolo - E3 trailer - Wii", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/guDNNKRA8Ck/hqdefault.jpg"}]}